WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:05.200
Have you ever wondered what SCP-168, the&nbsp;
Sentient Calculator, wants most in the world?

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:11.120
Foundation researchers snapped a photograph&nbsp;
of SCP-168 using SCP-978, the Desire Camera,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:14.000
while it was sitting on its&nbsp;
table. This was the result:

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.320
"An unidentified male teenager is using SCP-168&nbsp;
to solve several pages of mathematical equations;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:24.160
several textbooks (with titles such as&nbsp;
"Complicated Math", "Difficult Math",&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:26.880
and "Math You Need Your&nbsp;
Calculator For") are visible."

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:30.560
Sometimes the thing we want most in&nbsp;
the world is to serve our true purpose,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:35.520
to do the thing we feel we were made for.&nbsp;
A calculator just wants to calculate,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:39.840
and to help others do math. Maybe&nbsp;
it will get to do so again someday.

